% NPL SOURCE REFERENCE - MON 60B 075B - ITSTUSER check user SYSTEM (verbatim, 5P-P2-MON60.NPL)
ITSTUSER:    % FUNCTION=075: CHECK IF CURRENT USER IS USER SYSTEM
       IF 5PASSTYPE=2 GO FAR 5OKRET              % PASSTYPE=2 MEANS USER SYSTEM
       GO FAR EENAUTORISED; *)FILL               % ERROR, NOT USER SYSTEM
